<p>This will help those wishing to avoid going through every area layout to find the one they want. 
</p><p>The .lvl files for most of these areas can be downloaded from <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://social.bioware.com/project/1331/#files">the Single player and core resource source files</a> project, if you wish to modify the layouts in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Level%20editor" title="Level editor">level editor</a>.
</p>
